<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details 1996 fall seeding.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details 1996 fall seeding.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Thursday detailed the number of acres seeded in the fall of 1996 to winter wheat and fall rye.</p>
<p>			   1996 FALL SEEDINGS</p>
<p>		    1996	  1995	1986/95 Avg (acres)</p>
<p>W.Wheat	 110,000     120,000	188,500</p>
<p>Fall Rye	240,000     250,000	280,000</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
